Package: sharpQITE
Type: Package
Title: Design-Based Inference for Quantiles of Individual Treatment Effects
Version: 0.2.6
Authors@R: person("Jiangchuan", "Du", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "jiangchuand@uchicago.edu")
Description: Randomization tests and simultaneous confidence bands for
    quantiles of individual treatment effects in completely randomized
    experiments. Implements the rank Kolmogorov-Smirnov statistic with an
    exact dynamic programming reference distribution, Wilcoxon and Stephenson
    rank statistics, kernel conditional distribution covariate adjustment,
    sample splitting, and reproducible simulation comparisons. 
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, graphics, grDevices, utils
NeedsCompilation: no
